### oneplus auto enable bypass charging using abd
----------------------------------------------------

This script runs forever in the background, waits for your Pad to connect via ADB, then enables bypass charging once.

-> nvim ~/.local/bin/bypassd:

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash

while true; do
    adb wait-for-device
    sleep 3
    adb shell cmd statusbar click-tile \
        com.oplus.battery/com.oplus.powermanager.fuelgaue.bypasscharge.BypassChargeTile >/dev/null 2>&1
    adb wait-for-disconnect
done
```

-> chmod +x ~/.local/bin/bypassd

-> ~/.local/bin/bypassd &

-----------------------------------------------------
Now whenever you:
1. Plug in the Pad.
2. ADB connects.
3. Wait ~3 seconds.
➡️ Bypass charging is enabled automatically.
